# TECNO CM6 PMIC keys
#
# The side key reports Linux key code 605 (0x25d) from the
# "mtk-pmic-keys" input device.  Generic.kl has no mapping for 605,
# so the event is currently dropped by InputReader.
#
# The PMIC device also reports the normal power key.  Keep it mapped
# here because a device-specific keylayout replaces Generic.kl for this
# input device.
key 116   POWER
key 605   ASSIST
